{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim, sorry I missed you. Been a crazy few days. Took a trip to a new place - it's been amazing. Love the energy there."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-6e668edafc5d1afecba3de34", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.425075+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e668edafc5d1afecba3de34", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e668edafc5d1afecba3de34", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John, no worries! I get how life can be busy. Where did you go? Glad you had a great time! Exploring new places can be so inspiring and fun. I recently went to an event and it was fantastic. Being with other fans who love it too was so special. Have you ever gone to an event related to something you like?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-09a6196edfd6a546df89e863", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.450725+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "09a6196edfd6a546df89e863", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "09a6196edfd6a546df89e863", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I was in Chicago, it was awesome! It had so much energy and the locals were really friendly. It's great to experience other cultures and connect with new folks."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-8903116088dac091f460df94", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.473813+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8903116088dac091f460df94", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8903116088dac091f460df94", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow, Chicago sounds great! It's refreshing to try something new and connect with people from different backgrounds. Have you ever been to a sports game and felt a real connection with the other fans?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-b63bb3b56bc0c1e2e89030c3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.493113+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b63bb3b56bc0c1e2e89030c3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b63bb3b56bc0c1e2e89030c3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah! There's nothing like the energy in a stadium during a game. Everyone's cheering, chanting, and getting so excited. It's a really special experience!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-3e0e980c41ac119aa51d6337", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.513830+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3e0e980c41ac119aa51d6337", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3e0e980c41ac119aa51d6337", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I can just imagine the thrill of being in that kind of atmosphere. Must've been an amazing experience for you! BTW, I have been writing more articles - it lets me combine my love for reading and the joy of sharing great stories. Here's my latest one!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-5456745fb109ead85da4b51e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.530762+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5456745fb109ead85da4b51e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5456745fb109ead85da4b51e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's awesome! Have you come across any interesting books lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-9adf1ae8a1fa333a0755dc41", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.549602+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9adf1ae8a1fa333a0755dc41", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9adf1ae8a1fa333a0755dc41", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! \"The Name of the Wind\" is great. It's a fantasy novel with a great magician and musician protagonist. The world-building and character development are really good. Definitely worth a read if you're looking for something captivating!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-dc321a5eb1a81a7c4a1bd10a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.566388+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dc321a5eb1a81a7c4a1bd10a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dc321a5eb1a81a7c4a1bd10a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That book sounds awesome! Love a good fantasy with strong characters and cool world-building. Cheers for the suggestion. Adding it to my list. These are my lucky basketball shoes. They've been with me through the good and bad. Every mark has a story."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-d4b374adefc8cf736c0ac4c2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.583375+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d4b374adefc8cf736c0ac4c2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d4b374adefc8cf736c0ac4c2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Your shoes must have a lot of stories behind them. Want to share some with me?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-167351442ca10a72285e1794", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.602349+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "167351442ca10a72285e1794", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "167351442ca10a72285e1794", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yes, these have been with me on my journey since the beginning. All the successes, the failures, the friends - I have so many stories to tell. They're more than just a pair of shoes, they symbolize resilience, determination, and a love for the game. They remind me of what I've achieved and how far I've come."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-9cf5589fe22a9140c3985c9e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.622484+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9cf5589fe22a9140c3985c9e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9cf5589fe22a9140c3985c9e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Those shoes are special. They show your hard work, your successes, and all the amazing times you've had with basketball. It's awesome how meaningful objects can become. So inspiring. How did you get into the game?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-385d992e2deae85bbbc2120d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.644108+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "385d992e2deae85bbbc2120d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "385d992e2deae85bbbc2120d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Basketball has been a part of my life ever since I was a kid. I'd watch NBA games with my dad and dream of playing on those big courts. When I turned ten, dad signed me up for a local league, and I've been playing ever since. I kept playing through middle and high school before earning a college scholarship. And after college, I was drafted by a team \u2013 my dream come true!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-307d041aff77e4e82a0d77f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.660083+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "307d041aff77e4e82a0d77f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "307d041aff77e4e82a0d77f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow! You really made your childhood dream come true. It's impressive how your dedication and hard work paid off. It's awesome how our passions shape our lives. Do you have any big goals for your basketball career?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-49e4b371df5f5c36791b8938", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.684586+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "49e4b371df5f5c36791b8938", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "49e4b371df5f5c36791b8938", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah! Winning a championship is my number one goal. But I also want to make a difference away from the court, like through charity or inspiring people. Basketball has been great to me, so I want to give something back."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-fae2ca80d8194172c9fc24ee", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.705175+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fae2ca80d8194172c9fc24ee", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fae2ca80d8194172c9fc24ee", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Winning a title and making a difference off the court is inspiring. How do you plan to kick off your charity work?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-16c2fdaee1d143f8d7aa6ccf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.721665+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "16c2fdaee1d143f8d7aa6ccf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "16c2fdaee1d143f8d7aa6ccf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm teaming up with a local organization that helps disadvantaged kids with sports and school. I'm hoping to use my platform to have a positive impact on the community and inspire others as well."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-1aad0be046313b33beced5ad", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.745523+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1aad0be046313b33beced5ad", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1aad0be046313b33beced5ad", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Making a difference like that is truly amazing. I can't wait to see the impact it'll have. All the best for your charity work!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-b3ccc03ed6b9be82119eca4e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.763167+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b3ccc03ed6b9be82119eca4e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b3ccc03ed6b9be82119eca4e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Really appreciate the support. It means a lot. I'm excited to work hard and make a positive impact."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-e7e43f089e1551badcfc3aec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.785047+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e7e43f089e1551badcfc3aec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e7e43f089e1551badcfc3aec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: No worries. I'm here to support you. You've got tons of determination and passion! Keep it up - you're gonna make a difference!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-51b865f8f660fdfdc8b7a4ec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.799653+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "51b865f8f660fdfdc8b7a4ec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "51b865f8f660fdfdc8b7a4ec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Your words mean a lot. I'll do my best!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-305b37435daaf0d48f35bb24", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.814725+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "305b37435daaf0d48f35bb24", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "305b37435daaf0d48f35bb24", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Glad I could help. You've got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-a8a5b4eca727378aa7805638", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.830311+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a8a5b4eca727378aa7805638", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a8a5b4eca727378aa7805638", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Talk to you later!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_6-2174a5d7a56e35a1c806e22a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:34:37.848342+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2174a5d7a56e35a1c806e22a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2174a5d7a56e35a1c806e22a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
